  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> is defined by <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 270 left parenthesis 0.1 right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>270</mn></mrow><msup><mfenced><mn>0.1</mn></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math>. What is the value of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></math>?</p>",
